{"seq":1,"slug":"life-and-times","title":"香农·life-and-times","stage":"DONE","category":"claude-shannon","categoryLabel":"香农","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/19_claude-shannon/1_life-and-times","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"生平与时代\">生平与时代</h1><p>本卷以<strong>时间为轴</strong>，讲述克劳德·香农（一九一六—二〇〇一）的一生：从密歇根乡间既动手又好思的少年，到 MIT 的划时代硕士论文，到贝尔实验室的战时密码学与信息论诞生，再到晚年重返 MIT、与那颗爱玩的头脑相伴的岁月。香农是美国数学家与电气工程师，被誉为「信息论之父」与「信息时代之父」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷-分工边界\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷：分工边界</h2><p>本卷只回答「他是<strong>谁</strong>、一生<strong>何时何地发生了什么</strong>」，即人物传记与时代背景；具体的<strong>理论内容</strong>留给兄弟卷，避免重复展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 生平与时代（本卷）</td>\n<td>何人·何时·何地·何事</td>\n<td>传记主线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他贡献了<strong>什么</strong></td>\n<td>本卷点到为止，技术细节在此</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>怎么想</strong>问题</td>\n<td>抽象方法论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4 主要著作</a></td>\n<td>论文里<strong>写了什么</strong></td>\n<td>1948 论文/硕士论文逐节拆解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>他<strong>改变了什么</strong></td>\n<td>对数字时代的长远影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>该<strong>如何评判</strong>他</td>\n<td>信息论误用、整体评价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>凡涉及熵公式、信道容量、布尔代数的技术展开，本卷一律用相对链接指向卷 2/3/4，本卷只交代「在他生命的哪个节点发生」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[1 早年与天才] --&gt; B[2 贝尔实验室岁月]&#10;    B --&gt; C[3 晚年]&#10;    A -.方法论延续.-&gt; B&#10;    B -.人格延续.-&gt; C\">flowchart LR\n    A[1 早年与天才] --&gt; B[2 贝尔实验室岁月]\n    B --&gt; C[3 晚年]\n    A -.方法论延续.-&gt; B\n    B -.人格延续.-&gt; C</pre><ol>\n<li><strong>第一章·早年与天才</strong> — <a href=\"early-life-and-genius/a-tinkerer-and-thinker\">修补匠与思想家</a> → <a href=\"early-life-and-genius/mit-and-the-masters-thesis\">麻省理工与硕士论文</a>：理解他「具体↔抽象自由往返」的方法论起源。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章·贝尔实验室岁月</strong> — <a href=\"bell-labs-years/wartime-cryptography\">战时的密码学</a> → <a href=\"bell-labs-years/the-birth-of-information-theory\">信息论的诞生</a>：他一生的巅峰，也是信息时代的起点。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章·晚年</strong> — <a href=\"later-life/return-to-mit\">重返麻省理工</a> → <a href=\"later-life/a-playful-mind\">爱玩的头脑</a>：看一个功成名就者如何只为好奇而活。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置与建议\">前置与建议</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>无硬性前置</strong>：本卷是传记，零数学背景亦可通读。</li>\n<li>若读到熵、比特、信道容量等概念想深究其数学，请移步 <a href=\"../core-contributions/founding-information-theory/\">核心贡献·创立信息论</a> 与 <a href=\"../major-works/the-1948-paper/\">主要著作·一九四八年论文</a>。</li>\n<li>一条贯穿全卷的主线：香农反复施展同一种能力——<strong>发现两个看似无关领域背后的共同结构</strong>（逻辑↔电路、保密↔通信、玩具↔学习）。读时不妨留意这条暗线。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"early-life-and-genius","title":"早年与天才","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/early-life-and-genius","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-tinkerer-and-thinker","title":"修补匠与思想家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/early-life-and-genius/a-tinkerer-and-thinker"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mit-and-the-masters-thesis","title":"麻省理工与硕士论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/early-life-and-genius/mit-and-the-masters-thesis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"bell-labs-years","title":"贝尔实验室岁月","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/bell-labs-years","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wartime-cryptography","title":"战时的密码学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/bell-labs-years/wartime-cryptography"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-birth-of-information-theory","title":"信息论的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/bell-labs-years/the-birth-of-information-theory"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"later-life","title":"晚年","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/later-life","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"return-to-mit","title":"重返麻省理工","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/later-life/return-to-mit"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-playful-mind","title":"爱玩的头脑","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/life-and-times/later-life/a-playful-mind"}]}]}